{"markdown":"[![Cloudberry Solutions](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/cloudberry-full-logo.svg)![Cloudberry Solutions](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/logo.svg)](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/)\n\n[Home](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/) [About](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/about)\n\nServices\n\n[Contact](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/contact)\n\n[Get Started](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/contact)\n\nCloud • DevOps • AI Agents\n\n# Cloud, DevOps and AI solutions that drive outcomes\n\nWe help you migrate, modernize and automate on AWS with secure-by-default platforms and production-ready AI agents. Faster delivery, lower cost, higher reliability.\n\n[Explore Services](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/services) [Talk to an Expert](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/contact)\n\n### Migrate & Modernize\n\nAWS-first migration, right-sized architectures and cost governance.\n\n### DevSecOps by Design\n\nAutomated CI/CD, IaC, policy-as-code and continuous compliance.\n\n### AI Agents that Work\n\nTask-focused agents integrated with your data and systems.\n\nOur Expertise\n\n## Transformative Solutions for Modern Business\n\nWe deliver comprehensive cloud and AI solutions tailored to your unique business needs, helping you navigate the digital landscape with confidence.\n\n### Cloud Services\n\nComprehensive AWS cloud solutions focusing on migration, optimization, and security to unlock your business potential.\n\n- Cloud Migration & Strategy\n- Infrastructure Optimization\n- Security & Compliance\n- Cost Management\n\n[Learn More](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/cloud-services)\n\n### DevOps & DevSecOps\n\nStreamline your development pipeline and embed security from the start with our comprehensive DevOps solutions.\n\n- CI/CD Implementation\n- Infrastructure as Code\n- Containerization\n- Security Automation\n\n[Learn More](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/devops-services)\n\n### AI Agents & Automation\n\nTransform your business processes with intelligent AI agents that automate workflows and enhance decision-making.\n\n- Custom AI Development\n- Workflow Automation\n- NLP Solutions\n- System Integration\n\n[Learn More](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/ai-agents)\n\n### Platform Engineering\n\nBuild scalable, secure, and resilient platforms that empower your development teams and accelerate innovation.\n\n- Platform Development\n- API Management\n- Microservices\n- Performance Optimization\n\n[Learn More](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/platform-engineering)\n\n0\n\nProjects Completed\n\n0\n\nUptime Guaranteed\n\n0\n\nAverage Cost Reduction\n\n0\n\nTechnical Support\n\nClient Testimonials\n\n## What Our Clients Say\n\n> \"Cloudberry Solutions transformed our infrastructure by optimizing our AWS costs and implementing robust security measures. Their team's expertise helped us reduce our cloud spending by 40% while improving performance.\"\n\nSarah Chen\n\nCTO, TechFlow Solutions\n\n> \"Their migration strategy was seamless. We moved critical workloads to AWS with near-zero downtime and immediately saw gains in reliability and speed.\"\n\nArjun Mehta\n\nHead of Engineering, MediServe\n\n> \"The AI agents they built for us automated 80% of our customer support queries, freeing up our team to focus on complex issues. A total game-changer.\"\n\nDavid Lee\n\nCOO, Innovate Inc.\n\n> \"From cost optimization to security and CI/CD, Cloudberry became our long-term partner for platform engineering and growth.\"\n\nElena Rossi\n\nVP Product, ShopSphere\n\n> \"We needed a scalable and secure platform for our fintech app. Cloudberry's platform engineering team delivered a robust solution on EKS that exceeded our expectations.\"\n\nMaria Garcia\n\nFounder, FinSecure\n\n> \"Their DevOps expertise helped us streamline our release cycles from weeks to days. Our developers are happier and more productive.\"\n\nJames Taylor\n\nDirector of Engineering, CodeCrafters\n\n## Ready to Transform Your Business?\n\nLet's discuss how Cloudberry Solutions can help you leverage cloud technology and AI to accelerate your digital transformation journey.\n\n[Start Your Journey](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/contact) [Explore Our Services](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/services)\n\n![Cloudberry Solutions](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/logo.svg)Cloudberry Solutions\n\nEmpowering businesses with innovative cloud solutions, AI automation, and digital transformation services. Your trusted partner for AWS expertise and modern technology solutions.\n\n[LinkedIn](https://linkedin.com/company/cloudberry-solutions)[Twitter](https://twitter.com/cloudberry_sol)[GitHub](https://github.com/cloudberry-solutions)\n\n### Quick Links\n\n- [Home](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/)\n- [About Us](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/about)\n- [All Services](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/services)\n- [Contact](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/contact)\n\n### Our Services\n\n- [Cloud Services](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/cloud-services)\n- [DevOps & DevSecOps](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/devops-services)\n- [AI Agents & Automation](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/ai-agents)\n- [Platform Engineering](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/platform-engineering)\n\n### Get In Touch\n\n[info@cloudberrysolutions.in](mailto:info@cloudberrysolutions.in)\n\nMumbai, Maharashtra, India\n\n[Start Your Project](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/contact)\n\n### Stay Updated\n\nGet the latest insights on cloud technology, AI trends, and digital transformation.\n\nSubscribe\n\n© 2026 Cloudberry Solutions. All rights reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/privacy-policy) [Terms of Service](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/terms-of-service) [Cookie Policy](https://cloudberrysolutions.in/cookie-policy)","screenshot":"https://storage.googleapis.com/firecrawl-scrape-media/screenshot-c77a84b9-a1e3-4643-807b-e6c7246a9049.png?GoogleAccessId=scrape-bucket-accessor%40firecrawl.iam.gserviceaccount.com&Expires=1788734021&Signature=vt1x3xF2JBinoGMAt8AZ3Woal%2BNa6nuz4GC%2FvAPVaK